# route: level=w7_l2b_coop difficulty=beginner players=2 ends=exit after=expert_wall expect=wipes:0,painting:8,unlocked:true
# The Beginner two-stream route of Squid Grotto in co-op (designer D7; P1|P2, build/d7/bot_w7_l2b_coop.gd
# with the duo pilot build/d7/squid_duo2.gd). Club only, no S. The painting nook, the floes (P2 one floe
# behind), the roof hole; the co-op Inkjaw's Tentacle Lock: both wait on the middle island while it dives,
# the bubbles send P1 to the flank left of its gap and P2 to the right one; the hero the tentacle marks
# steps clear of it and comes back; each strikes the tentacle on his side (two heroes, G34) and the open
# head; phase 3 by the solo rule; both over the root ledges to the right island, the fire-starter, the
# exit totem.
